# Canonical Tundra model (YAML). See tundra.md for the language definition.

tundra: Marketplace listing and sale

roles:
  - Seller
  - Buyer
  - Platform

relationships:
  - Seller is Owner of Listing
  - Buyer is Offeror of Offer
  - Buyer is Party to Sale
  - Seller is Party to Sale
  - Platform is Moderator of Listing

contracts:
  - Only a Seller may create and edit their own Listing
  - A Listing may receive Offers only while it is Active
  - Only the Seller may accept or reject an Offer
  - Once an Offer is accepted, the Listing is no longer Active
  - Only a Platform administrator may suspend a Listing
  - Payment must be confirmed before a Sale is marked Complete

states:
  - Listing is Draft
  - Listing is Active
  - Listing is Suspended
  - Offer is Made
  - Offer is Accepted
  - Offer is Rejected
  - name: Sale is Awaiting Payment
    expires_in: 48 hours
  - Sale is Complete
  - Sale is Cancelled

processes:
  - name: Create Listing
    actor: Seller
    requires: no Listing exists
    results: Listing is Draft

  - name: Publish Listing
    actor: Seller
    requires: Listing is Draft
    results: Listing is Active

  - name: Make Offer
    actor: Buyer
    requires: Listing is Active
    results: Offer is Made

  - name: Accept Offer
    actor: Seller
    requires: Offer is Made
    results:
      - Offer is Accepted
      - Sale is Awaiting Payment

  - name: Reject Offer
    actor: Seller
    requires: Offer is Made
    results: Offer is Rejected

  - name: Confirm Payment
    actor: System
    requires: Sale is Awaiting Payment
    results: Sale is Complete

  - name: Suspend Listing
    actor: Platform
    requires: Listing is Active
    results: Listing is Suspended

  - name: Cancel Sale
    actor: Seller
    requires: Sale is Awaiting Payment
    results: Sale is Cancelled
    before: Complete

scenarios:
  - name: "Happy path: listing sold"
    steps:
      - Given no Listing exists
      - When the Seller creates a Listing
      - Then the Listing is Draft
      - When the Seller publishes the Listing
      - Then the Listing is Active
      - When a Buyer makes an Offer
      - Then an Offer is Made
      - When the Seller accepts the Offer
      - Then the Offer is Accepted
      - And the Listing is no longer Active
      - And the Sale is Awaiting Payment
      - When payment is confirmed
      - Then the Sale is Complete

  - name: "Error: buyer offers on suspended listing"
    steps:
      - Given the Listing is Suspended
      - When a Buyer tries to make an Offer
      - Then the offer is rejected
      - And the contract "A Listing may receive Offers only while it is Active" is broken

  - name: "Platform suspends a listing"
    steps:
      - Given the Listing is Active
      - When the Platform suspends the Listing
      - Then the Listing is Suspended
